WEBVTT

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:36.860 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.980 line:0%
[Episode 9]

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.120 line:0%
How did you get

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.480 line:0%
all these injuries?

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.960 line:0%
I accidentally fell.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.360 line:0%
The Grand Commander

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.960 line:0%
must have been too careless.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.200 line:0%
What I mean is,

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.000 line:0%
he didn't take good care of you.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.820 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.270 line:0%
women who get beaten at home

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.100 line:0%
usually say so.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.100 line:0%
Isn't that right?

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:17.670 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.330 line:0%
My lord,

00:02:24.129 --> 00:02:25.620 line:0%
what happened to you?

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:26.990 line:0%
Move, move, move aside!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.080 line:0%
Sit here. Sit down.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.120 line:0%
Take it easy.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.300 line:0%
What happened to you?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.230 line:0%
How did you hurt?

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:33.629 line:0%
Easy, easy, take it easy.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.790 line:0%
Where exactly are you injured?

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:41.070 line:0%
How did this happen?

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.940 line:0%
I fell, accidentally fell.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:47.680 line:0%
You fell too?

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.600 line:0%
Jiang the Stick-in-the-Mud.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.330 line:0%
Jiang the Stick-in-the-Mud.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.350 line:0%
I just wanted to watch a play.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:58.920 line:0%
The main act was only halfway through,

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.200 line:0%
and my father caught me and brought me back.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.660 line:0%
It must be that Jiang the Stick-in-the-Mud.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:05.960 line:0%
Tell me,

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.040 line:0%
was he

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:07.640 line:0%
sent by Wu

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.880 line:0%
to torture me?

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.400 line:0%
What exactly did I do

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.440 line:0%
to offend him?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:18.879 line:0%
My father said

00:03:18.879 --> 00:03:20.000 line:0%
there's no problem that can't be solved

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.120 line:0%
with a gold ingot.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.320 line:0%
If one doesn't work,

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.280 line:0%
then two will.

00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:26.680 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.520 line:0%
I really can't help you with this.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.280 line:0%
Chi

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.080 line:0%
asked to meet me

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.000 line:0%
at the Guangyue Restaurant today.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.640 line:0%
I have to go now.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.370 line:0%
You fickle woman!

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:39.879 line:0%
Xing,

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:42.879 line:0%
your

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.480 line:0%
head injury could be from a collision,

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.240 line:0%
but how did you

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.400 line:0%
hurt your leg?

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.320 line:0%
Did White Ghost bully you?

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.520 line:0%
No, no, no.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.820 line:0%
I have to go now.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.400 line:0%
Sir,

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.480 line:0%
a pancake, please.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.600 line:0%
The weather is lovely today.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.870 line:0%
Here, take your pancake.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.670 line:0%
Thank you. Put it on my tab.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:17.319 line:0%
Alright.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:29.710 line:0%
Secretary Lu.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:46.430 line:0%
Jiang the Stick-in-the-Mud.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.880 line:0%
Just be straightforward.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.320 line:0%
How much do you want?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.280 line:0%
You've given

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.200 line:0%
more than enough.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:08.750 line:0%
Come on.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:11.850 line:0%
Look over there.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:12.930 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.000 line:0%
Father,

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.600 line:0%
can you give me a gold ingot?

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:17.670 line:0%
[Lu Jinshan]

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:16.680 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.120 line:0%
buying this poor boy

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.600 line:0%
doesn't require gold.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.860 line:0%
A string of copper coins should suffice.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.760 line:0%
Here.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.000 line:0%
No,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.730 line:0%
I want a gold ingot.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.220 line:0%
Young lady,

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.490 line:0%
I'm yours from now on.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:32.640 line:0%
No need.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.320 line:0%
I've got plenty of servants.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.600 line:0%
A man shouldn't spend

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.080 line:0%
his life serving others.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.200 line:0%
You should do something more meaningful

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.520 line:0%
and protect more people.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.390 line:0%
Let's go.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.050 line:0%
[To Yan Xing, Ministry of Justice]

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:23.880 line:0%
Chi,

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.360 line:0%
we've been corresponding

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.840 line:0%
as friends for so long,

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.080 line:0%
and today we're finally meeting.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.610 line:0%
I'm actually a bit nervous.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.760 line:0%
I wonder what kind of

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:34.480 line:0%
beautiful lady

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.520 line:0%
you are.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.360 line:0%
My Lady,

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.640 line:0%
Dr. Yan has suddenly fallen ill.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.770 line:0%
Please return quickly to check on him.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.840 line:0%
[Father suddenly fell ill. Let's meet another time. Please understand.]

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:10.000 line:0%
Father suddenly fell ill.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.340 line:0%
Let's meet another time.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:12.470 line:0%
Please understand.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.250 line:0%
[Pan Chi]

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.720 line:0%
Father.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.280 line:0%
Father, how are you feeling?

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:34.020 line:0%
It's quite difficult for me to see you

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.600 line:0%
these days, Mrs. Shen.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.920 line:0%
And getting you

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.320 line:0%
to tell me the truth

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.480 line:0%
is even harder.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.540 line:0%
I wouldn't dare.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.720 line:0%
Wouldn't dare?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.240 line:0%
You know very well why

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.400 line:0%
I arranged for you to marry into

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.720 line:0%
the Shen family.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.040 line:0%
Yet all you

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.360 line:0%
report to me are trivial things

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.320 line:0%
like what Shen Du eats

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.850 line:0%
and drinks every day.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.810 line:0%
Minister Zhang,

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.880 line:0%
I know that once I entered the Shen family,

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.320 line:0%
I must help you

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.440 line:0%
by keeping an eye on Shen Du.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.490 line:0%
However, in the Shen's Mansion,

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.480 line:0%
I'm nothing more than

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:21.560 line:0%
a married woman.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.120 line:0%
All I can gather

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.850 line:0%
are details about daily life.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.400 line:0%
I've heard that in term of espionage,

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.960 line:0%
one must pay attention to the small details.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.240 line:0%
I'm afraid I might miss something,

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.600 line:0%
so I report everything.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.890 line:0%
If you still think it's not enough,

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.280 line:0%
then next month's secret report

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.950 line:0%
will include his daily routine,

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.040 line:0%
bathing habits,

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:37.349 line:0%
and bedroom activi--

00:08:37.349 --> 00:08:38.280 line:0%
Shut your mouth!

00:08:38.349 --> 00:08:39.680 line:0%
How can you, a young lady,

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.000 line:0%
speak so rudely?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.830 line:0%
Dr. Yan,

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:43.950 line:0%
this is your

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.800 line:0%
well-mannered daughter.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.920 line:0%
Please forgive us, Minister Zhang.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.650 line:0%
Please forgive us!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.400 line:0%
It's my fault for failing to teach her properly.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.040 line:0%
It's my fault!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.440 line:0%
I'm incapable

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.590 line:0%
and failed to gather useful intelligence.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:57.590 line:0%
Please

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.330 line:0%
don't blame my father for it.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.360 line:0%
Sixth Lady,

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.800 line:0%
I understand

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.240 line:0%
that once a woman is married,

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.440 line:0%
her husband becomes her whole world.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.720 line:0%
Her eyes and heart

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.200 line:0%
are filled with him.

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:20.760 line:0%
Even if she's wronged,

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.420 line:0%
she has to swallow it herself.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:23.920 line:0%
But

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.320 line:0%
the worst thing for a married woman

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.880 line:0%
is to have a husband who turns out to be a heartless man.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.010 line:0%
The Shen family case

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.320 line:0%
shocked the entire court back then.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.520 line:0%
You were still young at that time,

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.900 line:0%
but you must have heard about it.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.080 line:0%
Do you know

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.920 line:0%
who delivered the final blow

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:41.980 line:0%
to the Shen family?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.120 line:0%
It was Shen Du.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:55.050 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:07.800 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:08.860 line:0%
I've found out that

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.240 line:0%
all evidence and files of cases approved by

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.400 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.040 line:0%
and older than 10 years

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.840 line:0%
are stored in the Lintai's Secretariat.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.640 line:0%
Lintai?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.040 line:0%
However, the Secretariat's influence is deeply entrenched,

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.760 line:0%
and Lintai has always been heavily guarded.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.920 line:0%
Even the Imperial Guards

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.280 line:0%
are not allowed to approach without a reason.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:22.340 line:0%
It doesn't matter.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.660 line:0%
As long as the items are there,

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.080 line:0%
I'll find a way to get them.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:26.800 line:0%
Yes.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.480 line:0%
Besides,

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:31.680 line:0%
Madam returned to the Yan's Mansion at night.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.720 line:0%
Coincidentally,

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.120 line:0%
Minister Zhang also visited the Yan's Mansion tonight.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.830 line:0%
He didn't use the minister's carriage,

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.430 line:0%
but a regular sedan instead.

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.560 line:0%
I see.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.440 line:0%
I'll wait outside.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:02.200 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.680 line:0%
♫My heart burned, leaving me in desolation♫

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.670 line:0%
♫A lifetime of loneliness♫

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.870 line:0%
I hereby denounce.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.180 line:0%
♫Love flared, but where did it scatter?♫

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.670 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the criminal minister Shen Bingzhu,

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.430 line:0%
♫Where did it fade?♫

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.620 line:0%
accuse my father

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:43.070 line:0%
♫Drifting in the mist♫

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:43.050 line:0%
of colluding with foreign powers

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.890 line:0%
and aiding the rebels.

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:47.760 line:0%
♫Lost in vast waves, groping in the dark♫

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.150 line:0%
I hereby denounce!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:52.280 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the criminal minister Shen Bingzhu,

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.860 line:0%
♫You passed by, igniting sparks♫

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.750 line:0%
accuse my father

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.070 line:0%
of colluding with foreign powers

00:11:55.430 --> 00:12:00.580 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.300 line:0%
and aiding the rebels!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.560 line:0%
I hereby denounce!

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:05.280 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the criminal minister Shen Bingzhu,

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:07.370 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.700 line:0%
accuse my father

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.530 line:0%
of colluding with foreign powers

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:13.390 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.360 line:0%
and aiding the rebels!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.240 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:21.120 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.600 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.390 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.710 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.320 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:40.240 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:45.160 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:50.080 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.630 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.790 line:0%
why do you mock me?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.610 line:0%
I murdered my own son,

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.110 line:0%
but what about you?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.150 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.870 line:0%
You denounced your own father.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:58.240 line:0%
We are clearly the same kind of person.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.460 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.270 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.570 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.570 line:0%
Father,

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.530 line:0%
back then,

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.670 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.160 line:0%
I had no choice.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:09.420 line:0%
But now,

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.240 line:0%
as long as I can successfully get into Lintai,

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.620 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:13.840 line:0%
I can obtain the letters of treason

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:15.220 line:0%
from that time.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.680 line:0%
Once I prove they are forgeries,

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:20.780 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.820 line:0%
there will be one less piece of evidence against Father.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:27.610 line:0%
♫Willing to vanish into the world's uproar with you♫

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.080 line:0%
Back then, the Shen family case

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:45.760 line:0%
had solid evidence,

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.720 line:0%
Deputy Minister Shen kept proclaiming his innocence

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.360 line:0%
and refused to sign a confession.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.460 line:0%
Even after torture,

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:52.790 line:0%
he never admitted guilt until his death.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.610 line:0%
In the end, the case was closed with only physical evidence

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:55.770 line:0%
and no confession.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.530 line:0%
But who could have expected

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:58.560 line:0%
that after all these years,

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.040 line:0%
with the young emperor ascending to the throne

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:01.780 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.280 line:0%
and the Grand Empress Dowager in power,

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.640 line:0%
your dear husband Shen Du,

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.560 line:0%
in order to escape his criminal status and climb to a high position,

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.600 line:0%
would write a confession,

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:08.960 line:0%
admitting to all the crimes

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.680 line:0%
on behalf of his father

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.840 line:0%
one by one.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.200 line:0%
Who?

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:26.330 line:0%
It's me.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.550 line:0%
Your husband.

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:30.210 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.190 line:0%
Why are you covered in blood?

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:34.640 line:0%
Honey,

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:37.220 line:0%
do you want to know whose blood this is?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.520 line:0%
It's the blood of your entire Yan family,

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.760 line:0%
over a dozen people.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:42.670 line:0%
This is what you,

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.800 line:0%
a spy, deserve.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:56.040 line:0%
Are you really

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.370 line:0%
such a cold-hearted and ruthless person?

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.170 line:0%
The porridge is quite good.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:52.600 line:0%
Too sweet.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.740 line:0%
The pickles are crunchy.

00:17:13.659 --> 00:17:14.690 line:0%
Too salty.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.040 line:0%
I just love eating sweet porridge with salty pickles.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:21.950 line:0%
Uncle Zhong,

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.480 line:0%
make salty porridge with sweet snacks

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.149 line:0%
for future breakfasts.

00:17:26.899 --> 00:17:28.330 line:0%
What do you mean, Shen Du?

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.020 line:0%
I don't mean anything.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.570 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.100 line:0%
Is this who you really are?

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:42.740 line:0%
Are you truly this kind of person?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.890 line:0%
So what if I am?

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.560 line:0%
So what if I'm not?

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:49.640 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.520 line:0%
This is who I am.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:12.160 line:0%
I can't stand to see you treated this way.

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.480 line:0%
It's fine that woman don't behave herself,

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.000 line:0%
but she's even turned out to be a shrew.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:15.800 line:0%
At the beginning,

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.020 line:0%
she at least pretended to be proper,

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:20.020 line:0%
but after just a few days, she's shown her true colors.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.240 line:0%
You have your duties to attend to,

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.980 line:0%
and I have my responsibilities to fulfill.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.620 line:0%
We have to put on a show,

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.000 line:0%
but I won't take it too far.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:28.840 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.160 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:32.750 line:0%
tell me,

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.050 line:0%
would the ladies of Xiang'an City

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.160 line:0%
be more excited by the story of

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.690 line:0%
the Grand Commander's wife

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.760 line:0%
being beaten by her husband,

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.890 line:0%
or by White Ghost dealing with a shrew,

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.440 line:0%
making officials like Minister Zhang

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.880 line:0%
think they have a chance?

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.410 line:0%
It's been several days since our wedding day.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:53.010 line:0%
We should give people something to talk about.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.400 line:0%
You mean,

00:18:59.400 --> 00:18:59.960 line:0%
deliberately letting those

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:00.680 line:0%
with ulterior motives

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.720 line:0%
believe that the Shen family is in turmoil,

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.520 line:0%
so they'll let their guard down?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.720 line:0%
You're not so dumb after all.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:09.840 line:0%
So your argument today

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.960 line:0%
was intentional?

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:13.940 line:0%
Brilliant!

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.260 line:0%
Even the injuries on the madam

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.920 line:0%
were part of your plan?

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.640 line:0%
The Hongwen Academy has always recruited

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:35.240 line:0%
scholars of high rank.

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:37.360 line:0%
This time, the recruitment exam doesn't require recommendation letters

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:40.190 line:0%
[Recruitment Notice]

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.640 line:0%
and there is no investigation into family backgrounds.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.750 line:0%
How can they judge one's character?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:45.110 line:0%
[Top candidates will be admitted to the academy for study, preparing for the major exam next year.]

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:45.110 line:0%
[The purpose of not requiring a recommendation letter and not examining family background is to truly test the real abilities of scholars from all over the state.]

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:45.110 line:0%
[Starting this month, the Hongwen Academy will recruit several scholars for further study. This recruitment does not require...]

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.240 line:0%
So it just comes down to who writes the best essays.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.640 line:0%
Those country bumpkins,

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.260 line:0%
as long as they're willing to

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.840 line:0%
study really hard,

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.160 line:0%
might just win the prize

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.040 line:0%
and enter the academy.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.240 line:0%
I certainly don't want to be classmates with them.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.150 line:0%
[Top candidates will be admitted to the academy for study, preparing for the major exam next year.]

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.150 line:0%
[The purpose of not requiring a recommendation letter and not examining family background is to truly test the real abilities of scholars from all over the state.]

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:54.150 line:0%
[Starting this month, the Hongwen Academy will recruit several scholars for further study. This recruitment does not require...]

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.360 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.840 line:0%
the Hongwen Academy's exam is approaching.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:57.640 line:0%
This is

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:00.560 line:0%
the first time not considering family background.

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:01.600 line:0%
Scholars from humble backgrounds

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.040 line:0%
with knowledge and ability

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.680 line:0%
can all compete fairly.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.560 line:0%
It's of great significance.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.960 line:0%
Moreover, this time, scholars

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.680 line:0%
from Xichen and Nanlang are also

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.320 line:0%
allowed to take the exam together.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:13.120 line:0%
Therefore,

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:15.760 line:0%
every detail of this examination

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.600 line:0%
must be handled with utmost care.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:18.630 line:0%
Indeed,

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.440 line:0%
absolutely right.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:24.870 line:0%
This examination is unprecedented.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.620 line:0%
It will affect the reputation of our Cang State.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.310 line:0%
So, Minister Zhang, who do you think

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.800 line:0%
is capable of taking on this important task?

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:38.120 line:0%
Prince Xian

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:40.240 line:0%
has made significant contributions in disaster relief.

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.680 line:0%
People along the way sing his praises.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.050 line:0%
I suggest

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.690 line:0%
that Prince Xian

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.720 line:0%
be in charge of the examination.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.480 line:0%
Everyone knows

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.640 line:0%
that Prince Xian and Minister Zhang value family background.

00:20:58.640 --> 00:20:59.880 line:0%
If you're in charge,

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:01.000 line:0%
won't there be

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:04.000 line:0%
no chance at all for those from humble backgrounds?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.500 line:0%
You must have misunderstood.

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:09.800 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.360 line:0%
who do you think is more suitable?

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:14.410 line:0%
I think

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.810 line:0%
it would be better to let Shen Du take charge.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:20.000 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.000 line:0%
since when have you regarded

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.440 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen highly?

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:23.040 line:0%
You actually want

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.960 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau, responsible for military affairs,

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.720 line:0%
to manage a literary exam?

00:21:27.610 --> 00:21:29.540 line:0%
Lord Lai, your words are mistaken.

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:31.080 line:0%
Selecting the virtuous and promoting the capable,

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:33.080 line:0%
are all in service of Her Majesty.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:35.520 line:0%
Although the Hongwen Academy's exam is a literary test,

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.640 line:0%
the related arrangements

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.120 line:0%
are not just about writing and literature.

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:40.040 line:0%
It also requires a strong hand to take charge.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:42.200 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has always been meticulous in their work,

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.200 line:0%
and they will surely handle it well.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.280 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:47.050 line:0%
is willing to take responsibility

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.110 line:0%
and give it our all.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:50.330 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:52.200 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.100 line:0%
spends all day arresting people and handling cases,

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.100 line:0%
causing everyone to be on edge.

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:58.240 line:0%
Moreover, there are constant disputes

00:21:58.240 --> 00:21:59.950 line:0%
in the Shen household.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.080 line:0%
He lacks the ability to manage his own household.

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:03.440 line:0%
If Shen Du is put in charge of

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:04.680 line:0%
this examination,

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:06.570 line:0%
it would truly be

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:10.080 line:0%
a disgrace to literature, Your Majesty.

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:12.740 line:0%
Minister Zhang, you seem to know well

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:15.660 line:0%
about the Shen household's affairs.

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:18.040 line:0%
Enough.

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:19.480 line:0%
I'll think about

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.910 line:0%
this matter carefully.

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:28.080 line:0%
-I shall take my leave.
-I shall take my leave.

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:35.800 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:05.290 line:0%
Who's there?

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.270 line:0%
Sister Caiwei.

00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:10.560 line:0%
Please get up.

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:11.600 line:0%
Xing,

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:14.350 line:0%
I'm really sorry.

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:15.790 line:0%
Sister Caiwei,

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.120 line:0%
why are you back?

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:18.170 line:0%
Where is Mr. Han?

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:20.170 line:0%
You've suffered a lot for me.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.190 line:0%
Shiyuan and I decided

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.240 line:0%
to go home together to apologize,

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:25.160 line:0%
but...

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:27.210 line:0%
But I didn't dare to go home,

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:30.370 line:0%
so I had no choice

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.290 line:0%
but to hide outside the Shen's Mansion.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:35.680 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:37.860 line:0%
Sister Caiwei,

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:39.280 line:0%
don't blame yourself.

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:40.340 line:0%
Let's go home first

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:41.930 line:0%
and talk about everything.

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:44.620 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:44.120 line:0%
Yes. Over there.

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:46.000 line:0%
Come on. Down here.

00:23:46.050 --> 00:23:47.040 line:0%
Yes.

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:48.200 line:0%
Okay.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:50.400 line:0%
Come down quickly.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.190 line:0%
Third Lady and Sixth Lady are back.

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:55.390 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:54.960 line:0%
Master, Madam.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.170 line:0%
Third Lady and Sixth Lady are back!

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:58.920 line:0%
Master, Madam.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.970 line:0%
Third Lady and Sixth Lady are back!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.240 line:0%
Master, Madam.

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:05.240 line:0%
Caiwei is back?

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:05.880 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:07.010 line:0%
Third Lady and Sixth Lady are back.

00:24:07.010 --> 00:24:08.070 line:0%
-Mother.
-Caiwei.

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:11.240 line:0%
Caiwei, you're finally back.

00:24:11.320 --> 00:24:12.040 line:0%
I'm so worried about you.

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:13.320 line:0%
-Xing.
-Mother.

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:16.000 line:0%
Oh, my poor Xing.

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:18.080 line:0%
So the rumors outside are true.

00:24:18.080 --> 00:24:19.000 line:0%
That White Ghost

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.240 line:0%
really dared to hit you.

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:20.920 line:0%
Mother.

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:22.280 line:0%
You were kind-hearted,

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:23.960 line:0%
risking your life in the hell for others,

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:25.400 line:0%
but the ungrateful ones

00:24:25.430 --> 00:24:27.600 line:0%
are enjoying a family reunion,

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:29.660 line:0%
while only my poor Xing

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.920 line:0%
-was threatened, tortured, and beaten...
-Mother.

00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:34.880 line:0%
-by that White Ghost.
-Stop it.

00:24:36.280 --> 00:24:37.360 line:0%
No.

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:39.090 line:0%
-It's all...
-Xing.

00:24:40.980 --> 00:24:42.540 line:0%
I was too selfish,

00:24:42.720 --> 00:24:44.120 line:0%
only thinking of myself.

00:24:44.220 --> 00:24:45.840 line:0%
Today, outside the Shen's Mansion,

00:24:45.840 --> 00:24:46.950 line:0%
when I heard them say

00:24:46.950 --> 00:24:49.080 line:0%
you were insulted by that White Ghost,

00:24:49.150 --> 00:24:51.150 line:0%
I felt heartbroken.

00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:54.060 line:0%
That White Ghost even insulted you?

00:24:55.320 --> 00:24:56.180 line:0%
It should be...

00:24:56.540 --> 00:24:58.170 line:0%
mutual insults.

00:24:58.240 --> 00:24:59.920 line:0%
If this happens again,

00:24:59.940 --> 00:25:01.500 line:0%
I'll risk everything

00:25:01.530 --> 00:25:02.960 line:0%
and insult him together with you!

00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:04.240 line:0%
Mother, it really wasn't like that.

00:25:04.240 --> 00:25:06.560 line:0%
Everyone's here, everyone.

00:25:06.740 --> 00:25:08.860 line:0%
Stop, stop, stop.

00:25:08.960 --> 00:25:12.790 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:15.220 line:0%
Xing,

00:25:15.630 --> 00:25:18.400 line:0%
I heard that you were beaten

00:25:18.560 --> 00:25:19.720 line:0%
by White Ghost.

00:25:19.960 --> 00:25:20.880 line:0%
Just tell me, was it

00:25:20.880 --> 00:25:22.160 line:0%
because you're too stupid

00:25:22.160 --> 00:25:23.520 line:0%
to serve your husband,

00:25:23.540 --> 00:25:25.210 line:0%
-and you have a bad temper.
-You…

00:25:25.210 --> 00:25:27.830 line:0%
I'm telling you...

00:25:27.850 --> 00:25:29.070 line:0%
Sister Caiwei?

00:25:29.480 --> 00:25:30.960 line:0%
It's really you, Sister Caiwei.

00:25:30.960 --> 00:25:31.480 line:0%
Shut up!

00:25:31.480 --> 00:25:33.120 line:0%
Didn't you elope with someone?

00:25:33.120 --> 00:25:34.320 line:0%
You came home drunk

00:25:34.320 --> 00:25:35.120 line:0%
and stayed out all night.

00:25:35.120 --> 00:25:36.760 line:0%
How dare you!

00:25:37.120 --> 00:25:37.580 line:0%
Master!

00:25:37.600 --> 00:25:39.000 line:0%
-How dare you!
-Father!

00:25:39.300 --> 00:25:40.910 line:0%
-Master!
-How dare you!

00:25:41.170 --> 00:25:42.120 line:0%
Master.

00:25:42.670 --> 00:25:44.410 line:0%
Go back to your room!

00:25:44.560 --> 00:25:46.360 line:0%
Please calm down.

00:25:46.380 --> 00:25:48.180 line:0%
Fa... Father, I remember now.

00:25:48.960 --> 00:25:50.440 line:0%
On my way back just now,

00:25:51.160 --> 00:25:53.400 line:0%
I I saw that White... White Ghost,

00:25:53.520 --> 00:25:54.560 line:0%
leading a squad of Imperial Guards,

00:25:54.560 --> 00:25:55.860 line:0%
heading towards our house.

00:25:55.860 --> 00:25:57.590 line:0%
I don't know who they're after.

00:26:00.050 --> 00:26:03.020 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:26:16.670 --> 00:26:19.030 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:26:17.690 --> 00:26:19.350 line:0%
Greetings, Grand Commander.

00:26:25.620 --> 00:26:27.910 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:26:31.050 --> 00:26:33.380 line:0%
[Li's Mansion]

00:26:34.550 --> 00:26:35.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:02.560 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:27:03.430 --> 00:27:04.790 line:0%
This is all my fault.

00:27:05.320 --> 00:27:06.980 line:0%
It has nothing to do with Xing.

00:27:06.990 --> 00:27:09.000 line:0%
If there's any punishment, come at me.

00:27:09.000 --> 00:27:09.840 line:0%
Who are you?

00:27:14.240 --> 00:27:15.160 line:0%
Yan Caiwei.

00:27:16.600 --> 00:27:17.400 line:0%
Take her away!

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:21.440 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:23.000 line:0%
I am well aware

00:27:23.080 --> 00:27:24.780 line:0%
that the marriage alliance between the Shen and Yan families

00:27:24.780 --> 00:27:27.370 line:0%
has caused you displeasure.

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:29.670 line:0%
I also feel guilty about it.

00:27:29.760 --> 00:27:31.360 line:0%
However, the marriage between you and Xing

00:27:31.360 --> 00:27:32.830 line:0%
has already settled.

00:27:32.860 --> 00:27:33.800 line:0%
I hope you will

