00:40:04.590 --> 00:40:05.520 line:0%
"When light

00:40:05.560 --> 00:40:07.350 line:0%
reaches an object,

00:40:07.490 --> 00:40:08.480 line:0%
it casts a shadow."

00:40:08.480 --> 00:40:09.640 line:0%
This is a principle known

00:40:09.640 --> 00:40:10.640 line:0%
for thousands of years.

00:40:10.640 --> 00:40:12.120 line:0%
Anyone who reads books

00:40:12.120 --> 00:40:13.920 line:0%
should know this.

00:40:14.270 --> 00:40:16.080 line:0%
So this is not a secret

00:40:16.080 --> 00:40:17.040 line:0%
and shouldn't be used to deceive

00:40:17.040 --> 00:40:18.490 line:0%
common people.

00:40:18.810 --> 00:40:20.240 line:0%
You're quite

00:40:20.240 --> 00:40:21.570 line:0%
an interesting person.

00:40:21.960 --> 00:40:23.720 line:0%
Though you're in the Ghost Market,

00:40:23.720 --> 00:40:26.190 line:0%
you seem to be a scholar with integrity.

00:40:27.080 --> 00:40:28.720 line:0%
I just heard that this Hongwen Academy

00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:29.600 line:0%
doesn't consider family background

00:40:29.600 --> 00:40:30.600 line:0%
and selects scholars based on merit.

00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:32.330 line:0%
So I came to give it a try.

00:40:32.600 --> 00:40:33.900 line:0%
I see.

00:40:34.000 --> 00:40:36.000 line:0%
Then I wish you success in the exams.

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:37.840 line:0%
I usually prefer leisurely reading.

00:40:37.840 --> 00:40:39.180 line:0%
I can't

00:40:39.240 --> 00:40:40.600 line:0%
get into the classics,

00:40:40.720 --> 00:40:41.520 line:0%
so I'm afraid

00:40:41.640 --> 00:40:42.400 line:0%
I won't meet

00:40:42.400 --> 00:40:44.260 line:0%
the Hongwen Academy's standards

00:40:44.280 --> 00:40:45.760 line:0%
and can only make a living here

00:40:45.760 --> 00:40:46.960 line:0%
in the Ghost Market.

00:40:47.120 --> 00:40:48.850 line:0%
You're being too modest.

00:40:49.280 --> 00:40:51.040 line:0%
I see you have quite a grasp

00:40:51.040 --> 00:40:52.560 line:0%
of this art of light and shadow.

00:40:52.560 --> 00:40:53.940 line:0%
Actually, there's something

00:40:53.940 --> 00:40:55.340 line:0%
I'd like to ask you about.

00:40:55.400 --> 00:40:56.470 line:0%
Please,

00:40:56.500 --> 00:40:58.470 line:0%
just call me Pan.

00:40:59.650 --> 00:41:01.110 line:0%
If you have any questions,

00:41:01.120 --> 00:41:02.130 line:0%
feel free to ask.

00:41:02.160 --> 00:41:03.560 line:0%
Whether it's self-defense techniques

00:41:03.560 --> 00:41:05.090 line:0%
or ways to manage a husband,

00:41:05.100 --> 00:41:06.660 line:0%
I know a bit about them.

00:41:07.080 --> 00:41:08.480 line:0%
I don't need any of those.

00:41:09.200 --> 00:41:10.600 line:0%
By using your mechanism,

00:41:10.660 --> 00:41:11.850 line:0%
there's actually no ghost,

00:41:11.850 --> 00:41:13.510 line:0%
yet it seems as if there is one.

00:41:13.680 --> 00:41:14.680 line:0%
So, do you know

00:41:14.700 --> 00:41:15.860 line:0%
if there's a way

00:41:15.890 --> 00:41:17.230 line:0%
to make it seem like there's someone in the room

00:41:17.230 --> 00:41:17.980 line:0%
from the outside

00:41:17.980 --> 00:41:19.340 line:0%
even when there isn't?

00:41:20.920 --> 00:41:22.760 line:0%
There are no real ghosts or spirits in this world,

00:41:22.760 --> 00:41:23.520 line:0%
and no one knows

00:41:23.520 --> 00:41:25.050 line:0%
what they really look like.

00:41:25.120 --> 00:41:26.600 line:0%
But living people are different.

00:41:26.600 --> 00:41:28.060 line:0%
Each person has a unique appearance,

00:41:28.060 --> 00:41:28.940 line:0%
so it's not easy

00:41:28.970 --> 00:41:30.170 line:0%
to disguise oneself.

00:41:30.640 --> 00:41:31.440 line:0%
Exactly.

00:41:32.040 --> 00:41:32.800 line:0%
Well then,

00:41:32.800 --> 00:41:34.880 line:0%
miss, please tell me more

00:41:34.880 --> 00:41:35.880 line:0%
details about it.

00:41:36.240 --> 00:41:37.160 line:0%
For example, the time,

00:41:37.160 --> 00:41:37.940 line:0%
the lighting,

00:41:37.940 --> 00:41:39.120 line:0%
the position inside the room,

00:41:39.120 --> 00:41:40.240 line:0%
or the appearances of people inside

00:41:40.240 --> 00:41:41.080 line:0%
and outside.

00:41:41.600 --> 00:41:42.400 line:0%
Okay.

00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:48.390 line:0%
Bravo!

00:42:04.720 --> 00:42:06.420 line:0%
What are you doing at the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:42:06.420 --> 00:42:07.560 line:0%
I've found evidence!

00:42:07.560 --> 00:42:09.000 line:0%
Han Shiyuan was framed.

00:42:10.120 --> 00:42:10.980 line:0%
What evidence?

00:42:11.240 --> 00:42:12.680 line:0%
Come with me to the Hongwen Academy tonight.

00:42:12.680 --> 00:42:14.320 line:0%
I'll let you catch the real culprit on the spot.